window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Nightingale</i>: Part 2 of the Dark Duet</p> <p>Scarred but alive, Lark, and her men, survived the ordeal of their kidnapping and rescue. Now they’re in hiding from the syndicate that wants Lark and Apollo back, and the others disposed of.</p> <p>There’s more than just the issue of those who want her and her men captured or killed though, and it’s turned her world upside down yet again.</p> <p>With relationships old and new needing to be defined, anti-heroes becoming the protectors, and healing needing to be done all around, the group will have to work together to become a solid unit…or lose their chance at love and redemption.</p> <p>Find out what happens in the conclusion of the Dark Duet where the leading lady doesn't have to choose only one leading man and steam abounds.</p> <p>18+ advised for adult content—some situations may not be suitable for all listeners.</p>"; 
